  "observations": [
    "Baseline controls exposed generic More menus, contextless Mute/Solo/Effects buttons, numeric sliders without units, and generic Audio level meters.",
    "First metadata-only Menu.accessibilityLabel attempt reverted to More after state changes; preserved intermediate tree. Native Label(text, systemImage).iconOnly retained contextual names after updates and sheets.",
    "Final menus identify studio, named mix/input/source and Audio Unit. Level/pan AX values include -12 decibels and Left 25 percent; muted/unmuted and solo on/off are explicit; Effects reports Expanded/Collapsed.",
    "Built-in sliders identify decibels/hertz/ratio; zero high-pass reports Off. Selected Apple AUPeakLimiter parameters report current numeric values plus vendor unit names.",
    "Cmd-N opened Add input; Escape canceled with no mutation. Cmd-Shift-N opened Add mix; name entry and Return created a disposable mix with no output.",
    "Temporary route enabled by accessibility action; gain/pan set through AX. Input mute/solo and mix mute changed and exposed correct state, while studio stayed stopped.",
    "Audio Unit browser search, Tab, Down and Return selected/prepared Apple AUPeakLimiter; native inspector displayed contextual effect menu/Edit control and units. Return closed parameter sheet.",
    "Sound Check opened with no listening output, recording/play disabled and explicit effect values. Escape closed it without starting audio.",
    "Cmd-O and native file selection restored the original studio; exact saved session SHA256 returned to original value."
